                                "example_id": "c70316eb-0c96-4d13-a397-ebf845c9d438",
                                "sense_id": "6c466cd2-a4a0-3aff-9fd0-847e272e2cdd",
                                "text": "All the fragrances of dew, O angel, are there, / The myrrhic rapture of young hair, […]"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "80703fa5-1dcb-4ed1-8dd3-aeab22e0787b",
                                "sense_id": "6c466cd2-a4a0-3aff-9fd0-847e272e2cdd",
                                "text": "Above us the avern brooded like a gonfalon; from it there drifted a myrrhic perfume."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "6382ce6c-6bd3-471d-9438-0f83385df412",
                                "sense_id": "6c466cd2-a4a0-3aff-9fd0-847e272e2cdd",
                                "text": "It reverberates with layer on layer of flavour and aroma, from springtime zephyr at the top of the register to a myrrhic basso profundo."
                            }
